{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17826","headline":"圣恩洗雪镇州寄献裴相公 · 杨巨源","name":"圣恩洗雪镇州寄献裴相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天借春光洗绿林，战尘收尽见花阴。\n好生本是君王德，忍死何妨壮士心。\n曾贺截云翻栅远，仍闻劚冻下营深。\n井陉昨日双旗入，萧相无言泪湿襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}